# Scratch produced by audit runs. Reports, prompts, findings, scripts, and logs are tracked.
# Re-include the auditor's scripts and logs that a repository-wide pattern (for example *.log or *.R) would hide.
!*.log
!*.txt
!*.md
!*.json
!*.py
!*.R
!*.r
!*.sh
!*.jl
# Scratch directories: data extracts and copies, temp, caches.
evidence/*/data/
evidence/*/tmp/
evidence/*/cache/
.cache/
.tmp/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.keras/
.mpl/
*.pyc
